# Seasonal Cabins

---

## 3-Season Cabins

- Sleeping capacity of 20 each
- One-room style with bunk beds
- Two with covered deck
- Restroom facilities available at 3-Season Shower House
- Electricity available
- 4 Cabins: Gray Feather, Black Feather, Red Feather and Blue Feather

---

## 3-Season Shower house

- 7 showers with individual changing areas&nbsp;on each side
- 7 toilets&nbsp;each side
- Ideal for large groups&nbsp;

---

## Availability Note

Seasonal cabins are available for rental groups outside of our summer camp season. Contact us to confirm current availability and cabin assignments for your group.

---

## For More Information

For rates, availability, and booking, contact us:

**Phone**: (419) 883-3854

**Email**: info@otyokwah.org

**Address**: 3380 Tugend Rd, Butler, OH 44822

*Rentals not available June & July (summer camp season).*
